POST {{host}}/usuarios/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Mariano López",
  "email": "mariano@example.com",
  "password": "Password123"
}

### 0.2 — CREAR USUARIO 2 (MIEMBRO)
POST {{host}}/usuarios/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Ramiro Díaz",
  "email": "ramiro@example.com",
  "password": "Password123"
}

